<title>FRANCE: Soccer-Leading French league scorers.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Leading French league scorers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first division after Wednesday's matches: 12 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes) 10 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg) 9 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille), Alain Caveglia (Lyon), Anderson (Monaco) 8 - Anton Drobnjak (Bastia), Japhet N'Doram (Nantes) 7 - Leonardo (Paris St Germain) 6 - Moussa Saib (Auxerre), Thierry Henry, Victor Ikpeba (both Monaco), Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux)</p>
</text>
